{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e3aa5657fe29c594f852","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193387,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has given me a fascinating philosophical prompt: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\" And the concept is \"nothing.\"\n\nSo I'm asked to be nothing. To embody nothingness completely. To output only what nothing itself would say or express.\n\nThis is genuinely one of the more interesting creative/philosophical challenges. What would nothing say? What does nothingness express?\n\nLet me think about this"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}